WEBVTT

1
00:00:45.221 --> 00:00:47.451
Every day in the heart of Africa,

2
00:00:48.124 --> 00:00:51.685
amazing true stories happen
that no one ever sees.

3
00:00:54.064 --> 00:00:56.760
Not so long ago on these plains,

4
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.861
two mothers battled forces
that sought to destroy them.

5
00:01:31.034 --> 00:01:36.666
Only by showing extraordinary courage
would these mothers prevail.

6
00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:14.302
A mighty river divides this land.

7
00:02:16.946 --> 00:02:20.939
It marks the boundary
between two rival families of lions.

8
00:02:23.787 --> 00:02:26.847
To the south lives the River Pride,

9
00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:29.723
six lionesses and their cubs.

10
00:02:37.233 --> 00:02:39.030
They're a close-knit family,

11
00:02:39.169 --> 00:02:43.105
and rely on each other for comfort
and protection.

12
00:02:52.182 --> 00:02:56.380
Layla is the oldest
and most experienced lioness.

13
00:02:57.153 --> 00:02:58.882
She has just one cub,

14
00:02:59.823 --> 00:03:01.654
six-month-old Mara.

15
00:03:11.468 --> 00:03:14.266
Layla's age is starting to show.

16
00:03:15.071 --> 00:03:17.972
A lifetime of hunting has taken its toll.

17
00:03:35.258 --> 00:03:38.955
The cubs are fed and raised
by the lionesses,

18
00:03:38.995 --> 00:03:42.362
but they are protected
by the pride's ruler,

19
00:03:42.799 --> 00:03:44.061
Fang.

20
00:03:46.769 --> 00:03:50.227
His broken tooth is a war wound
from a recent battle,

21
00:03:50.273 --> 00:03:52.537
and a mark of his bravery.

22
00:03:54.177 --> 00:03:58.614
He is the father of all of the cubs
and their defender.

23
00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:07.056
To Mara, he's the best dad ever.

24
00:04:13.663 --> 00:04:16.655
Fang keeps Mara and her mother safe,

25
00:04:16.699 --> 00:04:18.963
and guards their pride lands,

26
00:04:20.036 --> 00:04:23.802
rich lands that every year
host a great migration

27
00:04:24.073 --> 00:04:25.904
a million strong.

28
00:04:38.054 --> 00:04:43.754
Fang lets all other lions know that
he alone rules the southern kingdom.

29
00:04:55.538 --> 00:04:58.905
North of the river
lives a very different cat,

30
00:04:59.342 --> 00:05:01.810
the fastest creature on land,

31
00:05:03.346 --> 00:05:04.836
a cheetah.

32
00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:11.081
Sita's life is different from a lion's
in every way,

33
00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.315
because she lives alone.

34
00:05:16.893 --> 00:05:19.623
Sita has a secret.

35
00:05:21.864 --> 00:05:27.803
Not long ago, she gave birth
in this grassy den to five cubs.

36
00:05:38.448 --> 00:05:40.973
They are still blind, helpless

37
00:05:41.684 --> 00:05:44.517
and totally reliant on their mother.

38
00:06:03.573 --> 00:06:05.632
Sita is a single mother,

39
00:06:05.675 --> 00:06:07.768
and with no pride to help her,

40
00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:11.769
she must leave her cubs all alone
when she hunts.

41
00:06:16.052 --> 00:06:19.317
Cheetahs may be the fastest animals
on land,

42
00:06:19.656 --> 00:06:22.056
but hunting still isn't easy.

43
00:06:23.326 --> 00:06:29.458
The Thomson's gazelles she favors
are almost as fast and very agile.

44
00:07:06.202 --> 00:07:10.332
Sita is built for speed,
but has no staying power.

45
00:07:11.174 --> 00:07:13.369
To have any chance,

46
00:07:13.409 --> 00:07:18.437
she must sneak as close as possible.

47
00:07:41.838 --> 00:07:44.739
Under 30 seconds before exhaustion.

48
00:07:44.774 --> 00:07:47.072
It's now or never.

49
00:08:39.128 --> 00:08:40.891
Success.

50
00:08:41.431 --> 00:08:45.458
Sita's cubs will not go hungry today.

51
00:09:04.854 --> 00:09:08.688
The river is a great bringer of life
to this wilderness,

52
00:09:09.425 --> 00:09:11.791
but it can also be a deadly foe.

53
00:09:12.995 --> 00:09:17.762
The surging rapids can carry
even the strongest lion to his death.

54
00:09:21.704 --> 00:09:24.935
This is where dragons dwell.

55
00:09:43.993 --> 00:09:48.521
The River Pride feeds on a dead hippo
washed up on the river's bank.

56
00:10:09.852 --> 00:10:13.982
Crocodiles don't fear
the rulers of the land,

57
00:10:14.023 --> 00:10:16.116
with one exception.

58
00:10:16.158 --> 00:10:17.455
Fang.

59
00:10:47.356 --> 00:10:51.292
Today, the pride's protector
has earned his keep.

60
00:10:57.633 --> 00:11:01.865
A crocodile-infested river
does have one benefit.

61
00:11:01.904 --> 00:11:05.465
It protects the pride from invasion
from the north.

62
00:11:12.915 --> 00:11:17.045
The northern kingdom is ruled
by Fang's greatest enemy,

63
00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:19.653
Kali.

64
00:11:38.407 --> 00:11:41.308
And Kali is not alone.

65
00:11:41.344 --> 00:11:44.245
He has four sons in their prime.

66
00:11:49.885 --> 00:11:54.948
Together, they form
the most powerful force in this land,

67
00:11:54.991 --> 00:11:57.289
one set on conquest.

68
00:12:09.405 --> 00:12:12.932
Kali already rules the lionesses
of the north,

69
00:12:12.975 --> 00:12:15.671
but he is not content with that.

70
00:12:22.685 --> 00:12:27.179
He and his sons are driven
to expand their realm to the south.

71
00:12:28.724 --> 00:12:30.851
lf he overthrows Fang,

72
00:12:30.893 --> 00:12:34.659
he will kill Mara
and have new cubs of his own.

73
00:12:35.264 --> 00:12:39.394
Kali is little Mara's greatest danger.

74
00:12:45.141 --> 00:12:47.473
For now, the river is high,

75
00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:50.274
a barrier that Kali will not cross.

76
00:12:51.147 --> 00:12:55.015
But eventually, its waters will fall.

77
00:13:35.524 --> 00:13:37.515
For Sita's five cubs,

78
00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:41.656
living in their snug little home
seems like paradise.

79
00:13:51.207 --> 00:13:54.074
The cubs are now old enough
For their first trip.

80
00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:57.108
The gazelle herds have moved on,

81
00:13:57.146 --> 00:13:59.842
and the family needs to catch up.

82
00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:12.418
Sita quickly discovers
that herding cats isn't easy.

83
00:14:28.043 --> 00:14:32.673
For Sita, it's time to cross
the open plains to find them food.

84
00:14:40.422 --> 00:14:43.823
For the cubs, it's a huge adventure.

85
00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.378
What an amazing first adventure.

86
00:15:57.166 --> 00:16:00.431
Massive herds
still cross Fang's southern kingdom,

87
00:16:00.603 --> 00:16:03.970
so food is plentiful for the River Pride.

88
00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:13.275
Layla may be old, but she is
the most experienced hunter.

89
00:16:23.826 --> 00:16:27.353
She knows the best place
to stage an ambush.

90
00:16:55.925 --> 00:16:58.723
The lionesses hunt as a team.

91
00:17:17.613 --> 00:17:22.915
With Layla leading,
they slowly begin to close the trap.

92
00:17:33.796 --> 00:17:39.098
Despite her aging body,
Layla is determined to help the pride.

93
00:18:07.196 --> 00:18:10.825
Hunting is always dangerous.

94
00:18:42.131 --> 00:18:44.065
Layla and her sisters must eat quickly

95
00:18:44.466 --> 00:18:47.333
if they are to get
the reward they deserve.

96
00:19:24.373 --> 00:19:29.003
Fang, the protector,
demands the lion's share.

97
00:19:40.255 --> 00:19:43.452
For Layla, the hunt is a disaster.

98
00:19:44.026 --> 00:19:46.790
A zebra's kick has injured her further.

99
00:19:48.363 --> 00:19:51.457
Staying fit is critical for a lioness.

100
00:19:51.834 --> 00:19:57.204
The pride cannot carry a female
who is too weak to hunt.

101
00:20:16.425 --> 00:20:18.120
Something's wrong.

102
00:20:21.463 --> 00:20:24.796
Kali and his sons are on patrol.

103
00:20:36.945 --> 00:20:39.778
Lions are Sita's greatest enemy.

104
00:20:43.552 --> 00:20:47.352
A male is more than five times her size.

105
00:20:53.262 --> 00:20:55.856
As a single cheetah, she would flee.

106
00:20:56.265 --> 00:21:00.133
But with dependent cubs,
she must hold her ground.

107
00:21:12.247 --> 00:21:15.216
She is totally focused on Kali.

108
00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:33.734
Incredibly, she's goading him.

109
00:21:44.146 --> 00:21:46.341
It seems insane, but it's a trick.

110
00:21:46.415 --> 00:21:49.179
She's drawing him away from her cubs.

111
00:21:59.494 --> 00:22:00.791
Kali tires.

112
00:22:01.897 --> 00:22:03.296
It worked.

113
00:22:10.472 --> 00:22:14.704
His son, however, is more determined.

114
00:22:35.464 --> 00:22:38.865
Sita is risking everything.

115
00:23:09.631 --> 00:23:13.328
Her speed has won the day, for now.

116
00:23:18.974 --> 00:23:22.603
Her terrified cubs
are scattered and lost, in danger

117
00:23:22.711 --> 00:23:25.339
until they're back with their mother.

118
00:23:54.543 --> 00:23:57.910
Time is not on their side.

119
00:24:04.653 --> 00:24:08.282
The dark will cloak other predators.

120
00:25:44.786 --> 00:25:47.448
It's a mother's worst nightmare.

121
00:25:47.489 --> 00:25:50.117
Hyenas have taken two of her cubs.

122
00:25:53.495 --> 00:25:55.429
They're gone forever.

123
00:26:03.705 --> 00:26:07.163
The season is changing
and the pride lands are drying.

124
00:26:08.076 --> 00:26:11.773
The great herds are moving on
in search of greener pastures.

125
00:26:17.819 --> 00:26:20.481
They may be gone for a year or more.

126
00:26:33.935 --> 00:26:35.232
With the herds gone,

127
00:26:35.837 --> 00:26:39.398
the River Pride will struggle
to find food.

128
00:26:40.675 --> 00:26:43.838
Layla is exhausted by her injuries.

129
00:26:47.182 --> 00:26:51.243
Mara tries to comfort her mother,
but there is little she can do.

130
00:27:04.666 --> 00:27:08.762
With the herds moving on,
the pride must follow.

131
00:27:09.704 --> 00:27:12.298
Layla cannot go on.

132
00:27:13.141 --> 00:27:16.440
She needs rest so her body can heal.

133
00:27:22.584 --> 00:27:25.314
Mara faces a terrible choice,

134
00:27:25.353 --> 00:27:28.652
stay with her mother
or follow the pride.

135
00:27:39.467 --> 00:27:42.129
Layla calls to the pride and to Mara,

136
00:27:42.571 --> 00:27:45.233
begging them to wait for her.

137
00:27:46.474 --> 00:27:49.910
But the pride must leave
in search of food.

138
00:27:50.812 --> 00:27:55.306
They cannot jeopardize themselves
and the other cubs.

139
00:28:11.766 --> 00:28:15.395
The pride moves
further and further away.

140
00:28:23.979 --> 00:28:27.005
Layla forces herself to try and follow.

141
00:28:28.883 --> 00:28:32.410
Mara stays with Layla,
but is in danger now.

142
00:28:33.455 --> 00:28:38.415
Mother and daughter
have lost the protection of the pride.

143
00:28:46.768 --> 00:28:51.000
Layla must find the strength
to catch up,

144
00:28:51.039 --> 00:28:53.439
For the sake of her daughter.

145
00:29:12.527 --> 00:29:15.360
Sita's cubs are growing in leaps
and bounds.

146
00:29:16.064 --> 00:29:20.057
In their minds,
they're the fiercest hunters in the land.

147
00:29:57.372 --> 00:29:58.669
Enemies approach.

148
00:29:59.974 --> 00:30:01.805
Three cheetah brothers.

149
00:30:06.414 --> 00:30:08.575
They may be fellow cheetahs,

150
00:30:08.616 --> 00:30:12.609
but these brothers can be dangerous
for Sita's cubs.

151
00:30:13.154 --> 00:30:17.056
They are the one foe
she cannot outrun.

152
00:31:38.439 --> 00:31:40.669
The brothers back down,

153
00:31:40.708 --> 00:31:43.734
but they have separated Sita
from her young.

154
00:31:45.580 --> 00:31:50.017
Male cheetahs
will sometimes attack small cubs.

155
00:32:21.082 --> 00:32:24.483
Incredibly, the cubs hold their ground.

156
00:32:26.187 --> 00:32:28.712
They have their mother's spirit.

157
00:32:44.072 --> 00:32:48.600
In this land, even bullies get bullied.

158
00:33:29.784 --> 00:33:32.981
The lionesses are tired
After their long journey.

159
00:33:33.554 --> 00:33:36.990
But cubs will be cubs
and siesta time is soon over.

160
00:34:00.381 --> 00:34:02.906
New playmates are always welcome.

161
00:34:13.361 --> 00:34:16.353
Luckily, he can't get the lid off.

162
00:34:31.312 --> 00:34:36.249
Layla and Mara have braved
the long journey and finally caught up.

163
00:34:37.652 --> 00:34:41.053
But their timing couldn't be worse.

164
00:34:45.893 --> 00:34:47.690
The river has fallen.

165
00:34:47.729 --> 00:34:50.596
The pride's protective moat has gone.

166
00:34:51.132 --> 00:34:55.501
Kali sees his chance
to invade the southern kingdom.

167
00:35:16.057 --> 00:35:21.290
Kali and his largest son cross
the crocodile-infested waters.

168
00:36:03.571 --> 00:36:05.505
Fang senses the danger.

169
00:36:06.407 --> 00:36:08.568
Sounding strong might deter an attack.

170
00:36:19.220 --> 00:36:22.087
But Kali is not fooled.

171
00:36:40.541 --> 00:36:42.975
Fang sees it's two against one.

172
00:36:43.010 --> 00:36:45.240
His chances are slim.

173
00:36:47.381 --> 00:36:48.905
Kali attacks.

174
00:36:51.285 --> 00:36:53.378
Fang has no answer.

175
00:36:56.524 --> 00:36:58.822
Kali's son threatens, too.

176
00:37:00.128 --> 00:37:04.428
Fang deserts his pride,
leaving them unprotected.

177
00:37:09.670 --> 00:37:12.969
Kali is poised for takeover.

178
00:37:15.143 --> 00:37:17.611
Mara may be killed.

179
00:37:22.283 --> 00:37:26.049
But a mother will do anything
to save her cub.

180
00:37:32.793 --> 00:37:34.852
Layla is the lionesses leader.

181
00:37:35.863 --> 00:37:37.160
Despite her injury,

182
00:37:37.198 --> 00:37:41.066
she puts herself between the invaders
and the precious cubs.

183
00:37:49.510 --> 00:37:52.673
Inspired by Layla,
the other lionesses attack.

184
00:38:43.965 --> 00:38:48.664
Layla and the lionesses have saved
the pride and their precious cubs.

185
00:38:49.437 --> 00:38:52.065
Kali has lost this battle,

186
00:38:52.106 --> 00:38:55.701
but next time
he may bring reinforcements.

187
00:38:59.513 --> 00:39:03.074
Fang has also been saved
by the lionesses.

188
00:39:04.018 --> 00:39:05.747
But for how long?

189
00:39:13.394 --> 00:39:16.329
The attack has taken a terrible toll.

190
00:39:37.251 --> 00:39:41.210
This little cub is badly hurt
and lucky to be alive,

191
00:39:41.255 --> 00:39:44.656
but Mara is nowhere to be found.

192
00:39:47.662 --> 00:39:51.291
Layla has taken
Another devastating blow in the fight.

193
00:39:51.932 --> 00:39:55.732
It takes all her strength
just to get to her feet.

194
00:40:03.177 --> 00:40:05.543
She must find her Mara.

195
00:40:08.749 --> 00:40:12.310
With a mother's desperate hope,
she calls for her cub.

196
00:41:14.615 --> 00:41:16.776
Mara has survived.

197
00:41:17.218 --> 00:41:20.278
Her mother's bravery has saved her.

198
00:41:35.302 --> 00:41:37.532
There is no greater bond

199
00:41:38.005 --> 00:41:41.668
than that between a lioness
and her cub.

200
00:42:02.797 --> 00:42:06.858
The rains have returned,
but the herds are still far away.

201
00:42:12.640 --> 00:42:14.972
Hunting is never easy.

202
00:42:15.376 --> 00:42:17.936
Now, it's dangerous for Sita as well.

203
00:43:05.759 --> 00:43:07.386
Hyenas.

204
00:43:10.965 --> 00:43:15.766
Sita has already lost two of her cubs
to these deadly enemies.

205
00:43:21.041 --> 00:43:23.976
Her biggest fear is that
they will steal the others.

206
00:43:42.029 --> 00:43:45.556
The hyenas call,
drawing in more and more of the pack.

207
00:43:50.237 --> 00:43:53.695
They know Sita is hiding something.

208
00:43:59.013 --> 00:44:01.675
Bit by bit, they tighten the noose.

209
00:45:20.060 --> 00:45:22.824
The hyenas have been kept at bay.

210
00:45:22.863 --> 00:45:27.095
This time, Sita's courageous defense
has saved the cubs.

211
00:45:57.064 --> 00:45:59.259
Cold, hard rain.

212
00:46:01.335 --> 00:46:04.168
This is a time of suffering for everyone.

213
00:46:56.790 --> 00:47:01.159
For the River Pride, the cold rain
has been a blessing in disguise.

214
00:47:01.862 --> 00:47:07.095
It allows them to appreciate the bond
and protection of a larger family.

215
00:47:10.070 --> 00:47:14.700
One of Layla's sisters, Malaika,
has small cubs of her own.

216
00:47:18.712 --> 00:47:21.203
With her injuries not healing,

217
00:47:21.248 --> 00:47:24.843
Layla is drawn closer
to her sister's family.

218
00:47:32.960 --> 00:47:36.020
lf Layla builds a bond with her sister,

219
00:47:36.063 --> 00:47:40.864
then Malaika might look after Mara
as well as her own cubs.

220
00:47:44.204 --> 00:47:46.502
Layla's time is short.

221
00:47:46.540 --> 00:47:51.603
Strengthening the bond with her sister
may be Mara's best chance to live.

222
00:47:57.184 --> 00:48:00.381
Layla may soon have to
give up her cub.

223
00:48:13.267 --> 00:48:17.363
And Mara's life will depend on
getting closer to her cousins.

224
00:49:05.552 --> 00:49:06.917
It's happening.

225
00:49:06.954 --> 00:49:10.651
Mara is being adopted by Malaika
and the pride.

226
00:49:17.464 --> 00:49:21.696
There's nothing better for a lion
than close companionship.

227
00:49:25.439 --> 00:49:26.929
With Mara safe,

228
00:49:27.441 --> 00:49:28.965
Layla can go.

229
00:49:42.155 --> 00:49:45.716
The time has come
for Layla to leave the pride

230
00:49:46.560 --> 00:49:47.822
forever.

231
00:50:44.584 --> 00:50:49.647
Layla struggles to find a quiet,
safe place to be alone.

232
00:51:04.171 --> 00:51:08.437
The pride is now far away.

233
00:51:14.014 --> 00:51:19.247
Mara searches for any scent,
any sign of her mother,

234
00:51:20.420 --> 00:51:22.047
but it's not there.

235
00:51:27.661 --> 00:51:31.188
All alone
with her precious cub far away,

236
00:51:33.100 --> 00:51:36.695
Layla, at last, gives up the fight.

237
00:52:46.640 --> 00:52:49.973
Sita's cubs have grown in size
and strength,

238
00:52:50.811 --> 00:52:54.008
and they can't wait to show off
their new powers.

239
00:53:37.457 --> 00:53:39.652
Since the failed invasion,

240
00:53:39.726 --> 00:53:44.754
Kali has prowled the southern side
of the river with his largest son.

241
00:53:45.298 --> 00:53:49.200
Now, he calls on his other sons
To join them.

242
00:54:35.649 --> 00:54:38.083
Kali goes to greet his sons.

243
00:54:38.618 --> 00:54:41.280
They have been separated
for some time.

244
00:55:08.081 --> 00:55:12.780
The family bonds between
these ruthless fighters are very strong.

245
00:55:15.388 --> 00:55:18.414
But there is also fierce rivalry
between them.

246
00:55:19.125 --> 00:55:22.288
They all want the crown.

247
00:55:31.238 --> 00:55:33.035
But Kali is their father

248
00:55:33.073 --> 00:55:36.941
and he lets them know
that he is still king.

249
00:55:52.692 --> 00:55:57.186
Together, they are the most powerful
force in the land.

250
00:56:12.812 --> 00:56:18.045
Together, they will make another
assault on Fang and the River Pride.

251
00:56:23.957 --> 00:56:29.589
Fang's future as leader
is hanging by a thread.

252
00:56:37.170 --> 00:56:41.698
As the months have passed,
the cubs have grown into young adults.

253
00:56:42.342 --> 00:56:46.369
Within this close-knit family,
Mara has thrived.

254
00:56:46.546 --> 00:56:49.640
She is now a teenager in lion years.

255
00:56:54.154 --> 00:56:59.148
The bonds of affection within the
River Pride have never been stronger.

256
00:57:18.244 --> 00:57:21.805
Kali and his sons
are coming with a vengeance.

257
00:57:37.764 --> 00:57:40.130
Fang's enemies lock in.

258
00:57:46.506 --> 00:57:48.474
They launch the attack.

259
00:57:48.742 --> 00:57:51.210
Fang's only hope is escape.

260
00:57:54.581 --> 00:57:56.742
He runs for his life.

261
00:58:04.891 --> 00:58:07.985
Fang will be shown no mercy
if he stays.

262
00:58:18.371 --> 00:58:21.101
Kali's gang is victorious,

263
00:58:21.741 --> 00:58:25.802
and Fang is never seen again.

264
00:58:31.284 --> 00:58:34.651
Now the invaders attack
the rest of the River Pride.

265
00:59:11.558 --> 00:59:14.049
The fighting is over.

266
00:59:22.168 --> 00:59:25.262
Kali and his sons rule.

267
00:59:26.172 --> 00:59:32.077
Their will is now law
on both sides of the river.

268
00:59:38.017 --> 00:59:41.043
Kali's sons try to make peace
with the lionesses.

269
00:59:44.524 --> 00:59:46.958
But in the battle
the youngsters were driven away.

270
00:59:47.527 --> 00:59:50.758
The pain of losing them
is still too fresh.

271
01:00:00.273 --> 01:00:03.709
The pride's young males
are in the greatest danger.

272
01:00:04.410 --> 01:00:08.972
Kali's gang view them as a threat
and hunt them down.

273
01:00:21.427 --> 01:00:23.895
Mara also fled in the battle,

274
01:00:23.930 --> 01:00:26.990
but as a lioness, is in less danger.

275
01:00:29.135 --> 01:00:32.400
For the first time in her life,
she is alone.

276
01:00:33.907 --> 01:00:35.966
She has lost everything.

277
01:00:39.445 --> 01:00:42.937
Kali's gang
drive out Mara's young male cousins,

278
01:00:43.249 --> 01:00:46.241
banishing them
from the pride lands forever.

279
01:00:46.653 --> 01:00:51.352
And there is only one escape route,
across the river.

280
01:00:53.459 --> 01:00:55.256
The river has swollen,

281
01:00:56.095 --> 01:01:00.361
but the young males
have no choice but to cross.

282
01:01:10.176 --> 01:01:14.476
And now,
the crocodiles have the advantage.

283
01:01:18.217 --> 01:01:22.085
The youngsters know
what lurks just beneath,

284
01:01:22.121 --> 01:01:26.057
but they fear Kali more
than they fear crocodiles.

285
01:01:48.815 --> 01:01:52.376
The current drags them down
into deeper water.

286
01:01:53.152 --> 01:01:56.679
They are in over their heads
in every sense.

287
01:02:33.259 --> 01:02:34.988
They've escaped,

288
01:02:35.028 --> 01:02:39.089
But just by the skin
of a crocodile's teeth.

289
01:02:53.646 --> 01:02:56.877
With all the warring between lions
south of the river,

290
01:02:57.350 --> 01:03:01.047
life in the north has been
relatively carefree for Sita.

291
01:03:01.954 --> 01:03:04.684
The cubs have grown to young adults,

292
01:03:04.991 --> 01:03:07.653
but they're still cubs at heart.

293
01:03:33.619 --> 01:03:36.452
Sita is not finished with their training.

294
01:03:36.923 --> 01:03:39.221
It's time for another journey,

295
01:03:39.525 --> 01:03:44.360
one where they can learn
the final lessons they'll need to survive.

296
01:03:58.211 --> 01:04:02.944
Lesson one, buffalo are very grumpy.

297
01:04:30.276 --> 01:04:34.406
Lesson two,
Never get fresh with an ostrich.

298
01:04:38.384 --> 01:04:42.013
The savanna
is the greatest schoolyard,

299
01:04:42.088 --> 01:04:45.057
but some of the other kids
are a bit different.

300
01:04:56.536 --> 01:05:00.131
A serval cat is drafted
into a game of tag.

301
01:05:13.619 --> 01:05:15.484
It's no fun for the serval,

302
01:05:15.822 --> 01:05:19.724
but the young cheetahs
can safely test their skills

303
01:05:19.759 --> 01:05:22.956
against smaller teeth and claws.

304
01:05:25.331 --> 01:05:29.995
And wouldn't every cat
just love to chase a dog?

305
01:05:32.338 --> 01:05:35.171
A jackal is the perfect size.

306
01:05:49.188 --> 01:05:52.851
Lesson three,
even little dogs bite back.

307
01:06:18.484 --> 01:06:20.179
Lesson four,

308
01:06:21.787 --> 01:06:23.118
hyenas.

309
01:06:23.956 --> 01:06:29.451
The cubs remember all too well
Their terrifying encounters with hyenas

310
01:06:29.495 --> 01:06:30.928
when they were small.

311
01:06:30.963 --> 01:06:35.161
Now, they must learn
to stand their ground.

312
01:07:09.635 --> 01:07:12.502
The cubs have finally come to terms
with hyenas.

313
01:07:13.372 --> 01:07:16.466
They're close
to becoming independent cheetahs.

314
01:07:16.876 --> 01:07:19.538
But not just yet.

315
01:07:26.385 --> 01:07:28.876
With her family blown to the wind,

316
01:07:29.455 --> 01:07:32.856
Mara has found living alone
a challenge.

317
01:07:33.459 --> 01:07:37.361
With no pride to hunt with her,
she's going hungry.

318
01:07:39.432 --> 01:07:45.598
Warthogs seem to be the perfect meal,
small, tasty and easy to catch.

319
01:08:24.210 --> 01:08:26.701
Not quite so easy after all.

320
01:08:31.517 --> 01:08:33.712
The herds are still gone,

321
01:08:33.753 --> 01:08:36.586
and all the other alternatives
seem to be

322
01:08:37.690 --> 01:08:39.282
super-sized.

323
01:08:43.496 --> 01:08:47.626
But young lions
think they're a match for anything.

324
01:08:55.441 --> 01:08:59.741
lf only Mara had taken Sita's class
in avoiding grumpy buffalo.

325
01:09:22.601 --> 01:09:27.004
Now the real cost of losing her family
is painfully clear.

326
01:09:27.706 --> 01:09:31.608
Mara was driven out
before she learnt to hunt.

327
01:09:41.754 --> 01:09:46.418
The gazelles that Sita hunts
have crossed the river to the south.

328
01:09:51.030 --> 01:09:54.363
She must follow them
or her family will starve.

329
01:10:01.941 --> 01:10:06.810
For the cubs, this may be
their most dangerous lesson yet.

330
01:10:11.217 --> 01:10:13.777
Sita rarely crosses the river.

331
01:10:14.386 --> 01:10:16.854
She knows it's deadly.

332
01:11:09.208 --> 01:11:12.439
They've just entered Kali's new realm.

333
01:11:28.427 --> 01:11:30.054
The River Pride lionesses

334
01:11:30.095 --> 01:11:33.792
once again proclaim
their ownership of the pride lands.

335
01:11:34.900 --> 01:11:37.300
They have made peace with Kali.

336
01:11:37.603 --> 01:11:41.198
Their new ruler has become
a committed protector.

337
01:11:49.682 --> 01:11:52.207
Mara is still an outcast.

338
01:11:52.818 --> 01:11:57.346
With food scarce, the lionesses
don't want Mara taking a share.

339
01:11:57.790 --> 01:12:00.623
She must fend for herself.

340
01:12:01.727 --> 01:12:03.592
It seems harsh,

341
01:12:03.629 --> 01:12:06.826
but the other lionesses
have new priorities.

342
01:12:10.236 --> 01:12:11.396
Cubs.

343
01:12:12.004 --> 01:12:13.494
Kali's cubs.

344
01:12:23.148 --> 01:12:25.309
Kali has achieved his goal.

345
01:12:25.751 --> 01:12:30.381
The lionesses
are now raising his cubs, not Fang's.

346
01:12:47.273 --> 01:12:51.767
Sita and her family confidently
stride across Kali's land.

347
01:13:01.220 --> 01:13:03.586
The young cheetahs
now have the confidence

348
01:13:03.622 --> 01:13:06.648
to challenge everything in their path.

349
01:13:15.868 --> 01:13:17.529
Even lions.

350
01:13:35.954 --> 01:13:37.251
But wait.

351
01:13:37.289 --> 01:13:41.658
The young cheetahs have yet to learn
that lions live in prides.

352
01:13:52.304 --> 01:13:54.898
The hunters are being hunted.

353
01:14:03.215 --> 01:14:06.150
This lesson is not hunting lions,

354
01:14:06.185 --> 01:14:08.016
it's escaping them!

355
01:14:37.950 --> 01:14:39.144
Kali.

356
01:14:39.818 --> 01:14:41.547
The game is over.

357
01:14:45.424 --> 01:14:47.984
The most important lesson,

358
01:14:48.026 --> 01:14:51.052
never mess with lions.

359
01:15:38.477 --> 01:15:43.176
The sight that Mara
and all the lions have been longing for.

360
01:15:52.858 --> 01:15:58.558
At last the great herds
are returning to the pride lands.

361
01:17:02.160 --> 01:17:05.561
For the lions, the good times are back.

362
01:17:06.865 --> 01:17:09.026
With the pride lands rich again,

363
01:17:09.468 --> 01:17:12.835
it's also a chance for Mara
to end her hunger.

364
01:18:22.674 --> 01:18:27.338
No longer hungry,
Mara has one last goal,

365
01:18:28.013 --> 01:18:31.608
to be accepted back
into the River Pride.

366
01:18:52.337 --> 01:18:54.396
Sita's work is done.

367
01:18:54.873 --> 01:18:58.434
She has taught her cubs
everything they need to know

368
01:18:58.477 --> 01:19:00.672
about this wilderness.

369
01:19:14.993 --> 01:19:18.952
The cubs have survived
the toughest of upbringings,

370
01:19:19.998 --> 01:19:22.626
but now they know what's safe,

371
01:19:22.668 --> 01:19:27.332
what's dangerous
and, above all, how to hunt.

372
01:19:48.927 --> 01:19:53.728
Sita knows her cubs are ready
to fend for themselves.

373
01:19:55.901 --> 01:20:00.065
She must return to the solitary life
of a cheetah.

374
01:20:07.212 --> 01:20:11.581
Against all odds, with the courage
that only a mother can bring,

375
01:20:12.117 --> 01:20:17.783
Sita has raised
three magnificent cheetahs.

376
01:20:31.803 --> 01:20:35.466
Mara is desperate
to rejoin her mother's pride

377
01:20:35.507 --> 01:20:37.031
into which she was born,

378
01:20:37.809 --> 01:20:41.176
but will Malaika and the lionesses
welcome her back?

379
01:22:05.463 --> 01:22:09.957
The lionesses have finally accepted
Mara back into their family.

380
01:22:10.502 --> 01:22:15.530
Layla's brave fight for her cub to live on
was not in vain.

381
01:22:42.634 --> 01:22:45.728
The River Pride is reborn.

382
01:23:09.461 --> 01:23:11.986
Sita's cubs and Mara

383
01:23:12.030 --> 01:23:16.967
are living proof
of the power of a mother's love.

384
01:23:19.000 --> 01:23:21.000
